Subject: build: PD_IOS_PROF_SRC, the in-app frame-breakdown instrument

Phase 3 needs to know where the frame goes, and on this device nothing outside
the app can tell it: xctrace/Instruments cannot attach to a sideloaded build
without a CoreDevice tunnel, which needs sudo on the Mac. So the profiler is
in the app (app/gfx/pd_frame_prof.c) and is read over the :8775 bridge.

This patch is the switch only. Without -DPD_IOS_PROF_SRC nothing is compiled,
PD_IOS_PROFILER is undefined, and every begin/end pair patch 0027 places
compiles to nothing - the oracle keeps building and replaying byte for byte.
With it, the file is added to SRC_PORT at -O2 and its directory goes on the
include path so the patched engine files can #include "pd_frame_prof.h".

diff --git a/CMakeLists.txt b/CMakeLists.txt
index 0c5b821e2..3bc021b45 100644
--- a/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -678,6 +678,28 @@ if(PD_GL_ANGLE)
   set_source_files_properties("${PD_ANGLE_GLUE}" PROPERTIES COMPILE_OPTIONS "-O2")
 endif()
 
+# PD_IOS_PROF_SRC: the frame-breakdown instrument (app/gfx/pd_frame_prof.c).
+#
+# Instruments cannot be attached from outside on a sideloaded iOS build -
+# xctrace needs a CoreDevice tunnel this environment does not have - so the
+# profiler lives in the app and is read over the :8775 bridge. It is additive
+# and outside the vendored tree, like the ANGLE glue; the directory holding it
+# goes on the include path so the overlay patches that place the begin/end
+# pairs can just #include "pd_frame_prof.h".
+#
+# Without the flag nothing here is compiled and PD_IOS_PROFILER is undefined,
+# so every begin/end pair the patches added compiles to nothing.
+if(PD_IOS_PROF_SRC)
+  if(NOT EXISTS "${PD_IOS_PROF_SRC}")
+    message(FATAL_ERROR "PD_IOS_PROF_SRC: no profiler at ${PD_IOS_PROF_SRC}")
+  endif()
+  get_filename_component(PD_IOS_PROF_DIR "${PD_IOS_PROF_SRC}" DIRECTORY)
+  include_directories("${PD_IOS_PROF_DIR}")
+  add_definitions(-DPD_IOS_PROFILER)
+  list(APPEND SRC_PORT "${PD_IOS_PROF_SRC}")
+  set_source_files_properties("${PD_IOS_PROF_SRC}" PROPERTIES COMPILE_OPTIONS "-O2")
+endif()
+
 set(SRC
   ${SRC_GAME}
   ${SRC_PORT}
